<p>This is an independent technical blog operated by Jiawei Cui, a developer based in Shenzhen, China. For any privacy question or data request, contact <strong>jiawei@cuijiawei.cn</strong>.</p>

<h2 id="2-information-we-collect">2. Information we collect</h2>
