<h2 id="6-your-rights-gdpr-and-pipl">6. Your rights (GDPR and PIPL)</h2>
<p>If you are in the European Economic Area or the United Kingdom, the GDPR gives you rights to access, rectify, port, or erase your personal data, and to object to its processing. If you are in mainland China, the <strong>Personal Information Protection Law (PIPL)</strong> grants corresponding rights. To exercise any of these rights, email <strong>jiawei@cuijiawei.cn</strong> and we will respond within the period required by law.</p>

